@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@
+# draft-advisor-master-data: Read advisor master data from the ERP
+
+- **Jira:** none yet (direct request)
+- **Gate:** design (trigger 2)
+- **Status:** Draft
+- **Approved-by:** <GitHub login> <YYYY-MM-DD>
+- **Baseline:** Discovery v0.1
+- **Module:** identity. Touches: integration (public API `readAdvisor`), erp-port (new operation), erp-fake (seed data), apps/worker (wiring)
+
+## Context
+
+Head office needs the advisor master data that the ERP leads. The platform reads it live through the integration module ([ADR-0017](../../adr/0017-erp-advisor-master-data-read.md)).
+
+## Acceptance criteria
+
+IDs only; `pnpm ids show <ID>` prints the text. No AC names the advisor read; the tests cover the ERP access rule.
+
+| ID | Test |
+|---|---|
+| T3-AC-001 | `packages/core/src/identity/identity.test.ts`, `packages/core/src/integration/integration.test.ts`, `apps/worker/src/worker.test.ts` |
+
+## Design increment
+
+- **Module file:** `identity`: `createIdentity({ repo, bus, integration, clock })`; `.getAdvisor(advisorNumber): Promise<Advisor | null>`; type `Advisor { advisorNumber, givenName, familyName, email, active, sourceVersion, readAt }`; AC T3-AC-001. `integration`: `Integration.readAdvisor(advisorNumber): Promise<ErpRead<AdvisorMasterData> | null>`. `erp-fake`: `fakeAdvisors` with `B20001`.
+- **Contracts:** ERP port operation `readAdvisor(advisorNumber)` with payload `AdvisorMasterData { advisorNumber: B + 5 digits, givenName, familyName, email, active: boolean, sourceVersion }`. No events.
+- **Schema:** none. The advisor data is read live and not stored.
+
+## Local decisions
+
+- `getAdvisor` returns `null` for an unknown advisor number, also for one that does not match `B` + 5 digits: the ERP decides what exists.
+- An ERP outage propagates as `ErpUnavailableError`: the conventions let the caller decide the fallback.
+- `sourceVersion` and `readAt` come from the `ErpRead` envelope (T2-D-009).
+
+## Out of scope
+
+- A stored copy of advisor data in `erp_copy` and its refresh.
+- The head office portal screen and the access rights for it.
+- The customer-to-advisor assignment.
+
+## Open questions
+
+- The Jira key of this story.
+
+## Deviations
+
+None.
